#: scenario2:scenario2_A824F1AA_C091_499F_A49D_2C364E7DBAFF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3fcc1f5e6eae2c4a85df751ea946c85e4cd3cee1df47e9447ca4c9582a94be38
#. default-sha256: 9663d856c7f3787723f227d85eb235a2cba99885be50e39cf2a690bc6907d2ad
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_A824F1AA_C091_499F_A49D_2C364E7DBAFF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫The beast’s humanity began slipping away from him after that encounter."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫Après cette rencontre, Bestia perdit le peu d’humanité qu’il avait réussi à acquérir."

#: scenario2:scenario2_CA94BCBB_0A21_4D60_AE2F_488D4AF685ED
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 861ff80007e7f394cca237c099d7c086d64679e301168f6e4f75b192a0248198
#. default-sha256: 2191a0b05fefd5b7896a16a9af79afc8c7489412f9f3568de6137663e08cdfa7
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_CA94BCBB_0A21_4D60_AE2F_488D4AF685ED"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He had returned to the thing I had found in the cellar. ⟪k:1⟫Actually, he prowled the "
"mansion’s halls looking more barbaric than ever."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il était revenu à la chose que j’avais trouvée dans la cave. ⟪k:1⟫En fait, il semblait plus "
"barbare que jamais en parcourant les couloirs du manoir."

#: scenario2:scenario2_0629C26B_E63D_4C99_96A0_0C3420D6F21C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
