#: scenario2:scenario2_BD734C9A_6BE8_4DF1_A1F8_9420881B20A6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b777a8e35f9e333337ac45e2bb869a315c66e7320ee6722b35228a62b91af014
#. default-sha256: 165837a0ac190ab7f689ae642b2a516a2f2416f95013ee1355133cc334a0b42a
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_BD734C9A_6BE8_4DF1_A1F8_9420881B20A6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eventually, Bestia discovered my hiding place. ⟪k:1⟫I had not felt regret in a very long "
"time, but I felt deep regret in that moment."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Et puis, Bestia trouva ma cachette. ⟪k:1⟫Cela faisait bien longtemps que je n’avais pas "
"ressenti de regret, mais là, j’étais effondrée sous le poids d’une immense culpabilité."

#: scenario2:scenario2_99E6D8AF_45E1_4FA0_998C_156756077979
