msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_44A70BCF_E7C4_4F48_922F_44612B539764"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I must satisfy these ⟪k:1⟫urges⟪k:2⟫!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Je dois satisfaire ces ⟪k:1⟫besoins⟪k:2⟫ !"

#: scenario2:scenario2_3658F769_8C7F_480E_A8E0_F7FA9C5DE928
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2be19ecbc33a5c05a645429bf074c49456574fe1637dff06a8115bb773831c6f
#. default-sha256: dc33e0039a721d81126b286796e878bafd46bae1235769da35dd015fc0cc00a0
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_3658F769_8C7F_480E_A8E0_F7FA9C5DE928"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Are you saying peace was not enough to sate you?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Vous dites que la paix ne vous suffit pas, que vous n’êtes pas rassasié ?"

#: scenario2:scenario2_74DDD056_1D04_48D8_ABCF_32277ECC01DF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6cfc2633dee3215538884a249a11d5a7e26d11dbdebec5e0ec561b513cffb460
#. default-sha256: a2ecc6665772cfdda61fbf30f1e29b8d8854520675c54b10e94df740b76a8fb4
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_74DDD056_1D04_48D8_ABCF_32277ECC01DF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Did I mishear you when you asked for peace?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Vous ai-je mal entendu quand vous appeliez de vos vœux la paix ?"

#: scenario2:scenario2_261F42AA_8689_4AD7_8968_57FF4EEECC49
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 00e2a1b5b31ddb8bd5b5b1dd4ef6c9d943886ad071071c2ec57966fd91de8105
#. default-sha256: c5c6976906809eab8effab82a59a2070724f686b99412ebd7473e35b02dc1bd4
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_261F42AA_8689_4AD7_8968_57FF4EEECC49"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I was mistaken...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Asking for peace won’t solve anything!⟪k:4⟫"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Je me suis trompé...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Chercher la paix ne va rien résoudre !⟪k:4⟫"

#: scenario2:scenario2_2FB5527E_7BE5_42EC_856F_6A709DB470D9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f4be4184a0dbe513f436832645fb891cefa68a6806cc12c77d203b43c14889ef
#. default-sha256: c2b8ce10c8a2c4bca95b4ed54d303dfe29184784b81965799f02c2131fb7a52b
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_2FB5527E_7BE5_42EC_856F_6A709DB470D9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Blood! Despair! Eyes filled with terror!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫These⟪k:4⟫ are the things I need!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Sang ! Désespoir ! Yeux remplis de terreur !⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫C’est ⟪k:3⟫ça⟪k:4⟫, ce dont j’ai "
"besoin !"

#: scenario2:scenario2_7BEAD8C7_5402_4EAA_B237_D81D80A53B63
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a469a4571d0b2ef11284f9c76b1f81c0936e0d48ca8b384605a001247b66f086
#. default-sha256: c6b33399d809704e06d742a3a03b50ea6e0c42201b45847f06b098f036fd44f2
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_7BEAD8C7_5402_4EAA_B237_D81D80A53B63"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And I’ve always known it!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Et je l’ai toujours su !"

#: scenario2:scenario2_042BD0C6_56E9_4935_A39D_6D2E017DDBF0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fb997ec3d151b4d8100b7c0167ba81c1af3d677dd84d3cc535f450b685b15321
#. default-sha256: 8dbb76ad2ad3b9eba7ecde26d0f114d687867aea2184f6eb74239f378fd462f5
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_042BD0C6_56E9_4935_A39D_6D2E017DDBF0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫You said this mansion fulfills people’s desires!⟪k:1⟫Then... ⟪k:2⟫Then..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Vous dites que ce manoir exauce les désirs des gens !⟪k:1⟫Alors... ⟪k:2⟫Alors..."

#: scenario2:scenario2_ABAFA661_B50D_44A5_A9CC_F2392825F410
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ceeffa727d6c21f6686f372230019efc8d32a909b638a5cd9545d2c472846ac3
#. default-sha256: 537962b94f2e2c5da648b0d0ef9b9dcb4c3b31047f2f8b511d0433534f5db014
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_ABAFA661_B50D_44A5_A9CC_F2392825F410"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Give me prey!⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫No more hares—⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫live "
"humans⟪k:12⟫!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Donnez-moi des proies !⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Plus de lièvres— mais des "
"⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫humains, en vie⟪k:12⟫ !"

#: scenario2:scenario2_36216E4E_37A8_4288_9365_AC3C7D3298A5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8285e84169b6331825a64160a1d7170bc400e681bd12ff1f9a6d84da9fdb9e0b
#. default-sha256: 292e7e510998b974db281016f855d8438b421d9427d77f7d49de07c1a5628334
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_36216E4E_37A8_4288_9365_AC3C7D3298A5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Why did I ever teach him to speak human language?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Pourquoi diable lui avais-je enseigné le langage humain ?"

#: scenario2:scenario2_3956845F_F173_49C2_B599_3DC3CE06B064
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d6625dbfb57f45914373ef6db90924fe5bc26617e49916123f03130653ef9425
#. default-sha256: a570599a9806b8d76c23d8c7a6a6762ac61156992180bb0d954acdd017cc7b30
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_3956845F_F173_49C2_B599_3DC3CE06B064"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Before long, the mansion granted his wish."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Il n’eut pas à attendre longtemps : le manoir exauça son vœu."

#: scenario2:scenario2_2D3DB347_9C5C_4348_9141_8DBA4EE15AA9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8aac2562b1d64a6963b28ce83b4c432c741688ca7efeba87c9452cc8081a7726
#. default-sha256: 8ad8fc7a26fa4404894ec4735fd78d904b086f14992c2915ab8df1a55a7cb3fa
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_2D3DB347_9C5C_4348_9141_8DBA4EE15AA9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Once a week, a villager or a traveling merchant from somewhere would wander into the forest, "
"ending up at the mansion on the cliff."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Une fois par semaine, un villageois ou un marchand itinérant errait dans la forêt et "
"finissait par atterrir au manoir sur la falaise."

#: scenario2:scenario2_EC3E1937_F81D_450E_AE1A_5424CC1137AF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8e3bd4c1dc506391542ea80a38e4c43ce98f912b0044e13d691f3b2c14802c13
#. default-sha256: 7852c9f7800f5db60982236a6d6fee0c2627384315958f2ab19c00efec115cc8
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_EC3E1937_F81D_450E_AE1A_5424CC1137AF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Though something ⟪k:1⟫felt⟪k:2⟫ suspicious about the man who greeted them at the door, on "
"the surface, he looked like a proper nobleman..."
msgstr ""
