msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫And by killing... ⟪k:8⟫no one can defy me!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Et en tuant... ⟪k:8⟫personne ne peut me narguer !"

#: scenario2:scenario2_5A82AD4A_21A6_4804_91A1_325B50427DA4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3d4675e989f20049c59d0614ac4765c7fbbaf3bd00d8600bd3e6a69f5f8e291b
#. default-sha256: dcac3ef4f213d66b08a4656ce8b20119791306f77506f8c0665805213a40cb81
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_5A82AD4A_21A6_4804_91A1_325B50427DA4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I have to show the world that I—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫that beasts are the most frightening "
"things on this earth!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Je dois montrer au monde que je—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫que les bêtes sont les créatures les "
"plus effrayantes sur terre !"

#: scenario2:scenario2_8BDF044C_D186_4600_9FE0_2F771AD37AA8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 24a0461bed2e5f6c4c6a6eacd5a56365eef34a49ba48b7dc1a98eaead1d720d1
#. default-sha256: d6778c7c0a7ea34f4332081c12316a5af2eaf3cdb8db0dbd8bfd93a464f007f8
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_8BDF044C_D186_4600_9FE0_2F771AD37AA8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The beast began to change his style, making sick banquets out of his kills."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Bestia se mit à changer de style et à organiser des banquets malsains avec les corps de "
"ceux qu’il avait tués."

#: scenario2:scenario2_6D0F9BE3_EE7F_4A02_9B59_FD751F965ABD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 58be9a1cf4153ff79c3869252f5e3c98265062331fbce58bbf74f75de25578cf
#. default-sha256: ba876d9389a3d8660fe2e9aeb11135c5642b74cd6e726c8be270faf77ea34f7e
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_6D0F9BE3_EE7F_4A02_9B59_FD751F965ABD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Some days, he would tie his guests up in the cellar, playing with them for hours until they "
"finally died. Some days, he would drain them of their blood and bathe in it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Parfois, il attachait ses hôtes à la cave et jouait avec eux pendant des heures jusqu’à ce "
"qu’ils finissent par mourir. Parfois, il les vidait de leur sang et se baignait dedans."

#: scenario2:scenario2_43450F3B_CB83_4100_A6A9_9D62AAD5DF0F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 38571ef27a7442c35d4184dde72e6b253793cbded5ed47bb2dcb02eb7048ac86
#. default-sha256: ab9483d061b84868306cc85feb5790d682a8b2a9fa1cb751418bcde410291d2e
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_43450F3B_CB83_4100_A6A9_9D62AAD5DF0F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Some days, he would spread them out on the table and feast upon them."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Parfois, il les mettait sur la table et les dévorait."

#: scenario2:scenario2_C090D098_8DF8_4383_BAEF_1AEA5CC2C259
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7843fb28cacc88128f00b35386c5faa89f6bd9604b75742115c19ec76b5c005e
#. default-sha256: cbd4e783faf60fe36e18f6af9a0c5f65630ccafb345be05ad7a5faa92ace07f8
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_C090D098_8DF8_4383_BAEF_1AEA5CC2C259"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Every week, another atrocious party. He did everything imaginable."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Chaque semaine, une autre fête atroce. Il faisait tout ce qui était imaginable."

#: scenario2:scenario2_06FE9D10_1C06_46A2_9E94_CF2DE181C38A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3f64733964e59ed1aca6bbccdf3a458693050670f0a3cd40f27928b6c87e7a94
#. default-sha256: 6e7e7e11d3f679614d5e43b05730db194979402113599462778d60fb8c4b3288
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_06FE9D10_1C06_46A2_9E94_CF2DE181C38A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫As a faithful servant of this house,⟪k:1⟫I am confident I can do most anything I am asked."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫En tant que fidèle servante de la maison,⟪k:1⟫je suis sûre de pouvoir faire à peu près tout "
"ce qu’on me demande."

#: scenario2:scenario2_F4AF7F68_0BC0_4848_92DB_988A42C2FD80
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1f2d6f783b4772a4262420b722c81d3cf686eb88a062319de52bcad0530319cd
#. default-sha256: ab98fe91fad486d1ef0046f02c867aea199002129180db2b36bd49d9452a6228
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_F4AF7F68_0BC0_4848_92DB_988A42C2FD80"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Though you can surely imagine my surprise at having to use the cooking skills I learned "
"while serving the flaxen-haired family to do ⟪k:1⟫that⟪k:2⟫."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mais vous pouvez imaginer aisément ma surprise quand je devais utiliser mes talents "
"culinaires appris sous la famille aux cheveux blonds pour faire cuire ⟪k:1⟫ça⟪k:2⟫."

#: scenario2:scenario2_530C961D_CCDA_4F61_845A_C516BABF7908
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c31901c54e885e4376bcb09ded0313df5d412e80bd77eb16d9b93c912b32fd86
#. default-sha256: b89e0ece67db41f47058271803471f5e2ee5f86d7caa73313d912d3787632bc3
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_530C961D_CCDA_4F61_845A_C516BABF7908"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I can only wonder if it actually tasted any good."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Tout ce que je pouvais faire, c’était me demander si ça avait bon goût."

#: scenario2:scenario2_0C5BD24B_7281_4455_A109_26B21102000D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 126bdbb566039c62507b49eaf24adbd009af61284b17a2c3196993fed1870129
#. default-sha256: af72d52e4cb65441c04fc7338845bfb3e3237212d8e711c48504b2860741c534
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_0C5BD24B_7281_4455_A109_26B21102000D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Bestia’s peculiar sword was always with him for his twisted banquets of self-gratification. "
"⟪k:1⟫However much blood stained it, it never lost its sheen."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La bête ne quittait pas son épée pendant ses banquets tordus où elle s’autocongratulait. "
"⟪k:1⟫Quel que soit le sang versé, la lame ne perdait jamais de son éclat."

#: scenario2:scenario2_1953702F_7296_4723_BCE0_1F8BD83EACCE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2b5fc6b49a6896c3190263c07bc5984965e5224e21b5f70a664292e969b75f9b
#. default-sha256: a469a7635f92573d50991c2aaefaa106e66225340864bdfb0e830835b3312602
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_1953702F_7296_4723_BCE0_1F8BD83EACCE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It was as though the sword drank of the flesh of humans."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫C’était comme si l’épée se nourrissait de chair humaine."

#: scenario2:scenario2_8542B195_B8E7_4EAE_8626_225DEC8E1FDB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d3a34176a3d116fcf2d3a8851158a3c4954081fd0ee7024ac2cf3fd1496c9e82
#. default-sha256: 46c82a39360d977b5cac7de179d3ec1fa3dfa1f5d63138afc12c95819b4b5158
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_8542B195_B8E7_4EAE_8626_225DEC8E1FDB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Master, can you imagine just how wretched I felt?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Maître, pouvez-vous imaginer comme je me sentais malheureuse ?"

#: scenario2:scenario2_35809AC2_871E_4E58_ACF8_77BC037F72A7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 46aa113f391373eb5e00cb83ae9ac5bcb7fb1fc85270d47ccdeef7c3d32b86e9
#. default-sha256: a5d1b3fa651e8e6206bf0a0c0ab6c2e23c8a34fa51ab2cc04863e86c3c5f15d1
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_35809AC2_871E_4E58_ACF8_77BC037F72A7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The mansion, once a beautiful sight to behold, reeked of death and acrimony."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Le manoir, qui était autrefois un endroit magnifique, puait la mort et le fiel."

#: scenario2:scenario2_689F9549_2E43_45D4_8E24_B15BC5CDB8A7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bb94bcac441ede0bf5da2fc28d2085db3bcf9817ba6c5109a1cf7359ddba8ea8
