msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_689F9549_2E43_45D4_8E24_B15BC5CDB8A7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The stench of rotting flesh seeped up from the cellar."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫L’odeur de chair pourrie suintait depuis la cave."

#: scenario2:scenario2_5BF7EDE5_0CBD_45DB_B4EC_8AC9173E9A8C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e7137ccaf42819d0b36c9769290203d8ee68e8629ff9d5c339047dc183b9b1ef
#. default-sha256: 379d8816706fd9c528227503bc6a292a784a2a2513c2ef553ee447524e35affb
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_5BF7EDE5_0CBD_45DB_B4EC_8AC9173E9A8C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Even the years it spent forsaken and in ruins were preferable to that."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Même les années qu’il avait passées à l’abandon et en ruine étaient préférables à une telle "
"situation."

#: scenario2:scenario2_FA8D4794_63A8_4D8F_A7EB_100E4A25EC3B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 01bed4fa82463031d504775b46a229e63e57ec693cdb82ac8c916fc5cbf78f20
#. default-sha256: eab6e3c8d24e6b24d1bc730adb07eba6483c39e059a5f5623f501f35a12594ef
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_FA8D4794_63A8_4D8F_A7EB_100E4A25EC3B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Or perhaps I only had myself to blame."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Peut-être ne pouvais-je m’en prendre qu’à moi-même."

#: scenario2:scenario2_E3B343BD_E899_4022_9C41_51CE8670C6E6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b5b2549e2ac1a7c7967963342fcf1c232a449056adf9058c715285e650d1425b
#. default-sha256: b03fb65bde27ba3fb43cb4ba1c04ea8522fb47193af5b175a3af1a5b69ebd7b8
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_E3B343BD_E899_4022_9C41_51CE8670C6E6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It was I who had invited the beast into the mansion."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫C’était moi qui avais invité la bête au manoir."

#: scenario2:scenario2_FF896223_520A_4C04_8CE2_96126F1601DC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 65e4cc6416b1918227f26ce106e417147d497c76c03f6beba640cef39db2c671
#. default-sha256: 83cb33151795163f4297b5ca86f02d0e9819a8b7d084774ab63297483105f797
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_FF896223_520A_4C04_8CE2_96126F1601DC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫More, ⟪k:1⟫moooore⟪k:2⟫... ⟪k:3⟫Not enough...⟪k:4⟫This isn’t enough to satisfy me..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Plus, ⟪k:1⟫pluuuus⟪k:2⟫... ⟪k:3⟫Pas assez...⟪k:4⟫Il n’y en a pas assez pour me satisfaire..."

#: scenario2:scenario2_15FEBCF0_88B6_45E8_86BF_74FECCE3C1F4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6810f5176f5ab82f40bfeff0f35988c8ea168011c47320e0cab6ed240fc3659b
#. default-sha256: e4b0d9c9d1c1532050b0a3c2d8b3c63f61413ab30c1a12122d92f0b6cf01410d
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_15FEBCF0_88B6_45E8_86BF_74FECCE3C1F4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But Bestia still sought to hold more of his perverse parties.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Lost villagers were "
"no longer enough to quell his urges."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mais Bestia cherchait toujours à faire encore plus de fêtes perverses.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Les "
"villageois égarés n’étaient plus en mesure d’apaiser ses besoins."

#: scenario2:scenario2_9E470691_8AFE_449B_B23A_2012264CBAE9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 08091142a4d973d7700d486a79013e957c66910b3fdbb21da0a573f065795957
#. default-sha256: 4646aa4727d23f16ff57fdea454c668142cc2c26c0ee434ba6589e45706c4ebc
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_9E470691_8AFE_449B_B23A_2012264CBAE9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He was, indeed, a genuine beast.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫And in time, this is what he began to wish for:"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫C’était, en effet, une vraie bête.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Et à l’époque, voici ce qu’il commença à "
"souhaiter :"

#: scenario2:scenario2_7B5A78AB_13CA_492C_9571_D09676070009
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5280f0f6106d45699a24d1aeb82a493e528bb1cb07fa10bd8b1137f4f283cce1
#. default-sha256: aee17517499ff6ba13e8e32a585ab7449508ffa90a0c0a1833c75efd46d458e9
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_7B5A78AB_13CA_492C_9571_D09676070009"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Can’t you get me any better prey?!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Something truly exquisite!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫The perfect "
"prey to quench this maddening thirst of mine!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ne pouvez-vous pas me trouver de meilleures proies ?!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Quelque chose de vraiment "
"exquis !⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫La proie parfaite pour apaiser cette soif folle qui me dévore !"

#: scenario2:scenario2_B2F77B85_76EC_4DBB_9564_A2739C441FAA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fe7c41b472e93a552927af17112575d25df7041ad052a1b3f597df4f51868173
#. default-sha256: 402206c6210dea13a0c64fe556f0b15657fa40c4f713b0058a8a94796c6e3f74
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_B2F77B85_76EC_4DBB_9564_A2739C441FAA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Do you know what he meant when he asked for the “perfect” prey, Master?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Savez-vous ce qu’il voulait dire en demandant une proie « parfaite », Maître ?"

#: scenario2:scenario2_A9170792_5C88_465B_BDB7_DBDD7D3CFC33
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7fd17186728936b1eabd50ee4aa8a95f037509319ee087e70b3b0c42aa64ebb2
#. default-sha256: 28dd361c042b607b4e073c5eaa24236d83cf5ff31f83b3b13c8af82773a9976a
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_A9170792_5C88_465B_BDB7_DBDD7D3CFC33"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Perhaps a hero, someone courageous enough to stand up to him, with whom he could enjoy a "
"battle to the death."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Peut-être un héros, quelqu’un d’assez courageux pour lui tenir tête, contre qui il pourrait "
"apprécier un combat à mort."

#: scenario2:scenario2_ED8F0C0F_DF6E_4C21_8DD8_E3C6463496E0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f05d5f258a7e05975cff9cb27ed5ba005165491a40da82c78d37014ffa292ec5
#. default-sha256: 851dc1ae75d61dd0932548731c517090342b1e743a7953014888237c13b510da
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_ED8F0C0F_DF6E_4C21_8DD8_E3C6463496E0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Perhaps a dazzling young nymph to satisfy his other primal urges.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Or perhaps what "
"he wanted was not human at all,⟪k:3⟫but a demon or a phantom."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Peut-être une jeune nymphe éblouissante pour satisfaire ses autres besoins primaires.⟪k:1⟫"
"⟪k:2⟫Ou encore quelque chose qui n’était pas du tout humain,⟪k:3⟫un démon ou un fantôme."

#: scenario2:scenario2_4BDF0F89_2E12_4091_8E35_7392A6CC8A44
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 80ca83232926821576a8a0244f12b9d12e20326f8b09b9dffa109331bb289266
#. default-sha256: db4538bab68973ec613836e8ec5f484badd8f16f07cbe91f38fbe6d75f4aa9e0
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_4BDF0F89_2E12_4091_8E35_7392A6CC8A44"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I would soon find out, as the mansion attempted to grant his wish, bringing yet another "
"guest to the house on the cliff.⟪k:1⟫"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫J’allais vite le découvrir car le manoir tenta de lui accorder son vœu en amenant un autre "
"invité dans la maison sur la falaise.⟪k:1⟫"
